      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A high-level leader with executive presence typically exudes confidence, assertiveness, and poise. Key personality traits include strong self-awareness, strategic thinking, analytical skills, and the ability to articulate a clear vision and vision-driven goals. Effective communicators in this role are often comfortable with power dynamics, can navigate complex stakeholder groups, and can distill complex ideas into actionable insights. They also possess emotional intelligence, resilience, and a strong work ethic.",
